     "speaker": "Hafsa",
     "text": "No, I didn't. I went to the market, but I paid with cash."
    },
    {
     "speaker": "Clerk",
     "text": "I see the mistake. It was a fee for an old account. You didn't do anything wrong."
    },
    {
